        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "上一段讲到「Hopfield 网络」。现在把镜头转向「自组织映射」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：研究者为什么需要「自组织映射」？当时已有的方法究竟卡在了哪里？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "泰沃·科霍宁提出自组织映射，这类自适应网络把输出单元排列成保持输入信号拓扑的映射。该方法把无监督竞争学习可视化为二维网格。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-self-organized-formation-of-topologically-correct-feature-maps"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "最佳匹配单元及其邻居向输入移动，逐渐形成保持拓扑的映射。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-self-organized-formation-of-topologically-correct-feature-maps"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把自组织映射视为用于可视化和拓扑保持的经典无监督神经模型。它的长期影响在于竞争学习地图仍被用于解释聚类、向量量化和可解释低维组织。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-self-organized-formation-of-topologically-correct-feature-maps"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "这条线索还没有结束。接下来来到「深度置信网络」，我们会看到研究者怎样把问题继续向前推进。",
